OL,3,GNEWSATom Jones announced as On the
OL,4,AWaterfront headliner
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Tom Jones is set to return to
OL,7,FLiverpool next summer as a headliner
OL,8,Ffor On the Waterfront 2027.
OL,10,FThe Welsh singer, whose hits include
OL,11,FIt's Not Unusual and Delilah, will
OL,12,Fperform at the city's Pier Head on 20
OL,13,FJune.
OL,15,FHe joins Jamie Webster, who has already
OL,16,Fbeen announced as the headline act for
OL,17,F18 June.
OL,19,FSir Tom recently returned to performing
OL,20,Fafter being forced to cancel a number
OL,21,Fof concerts because of illness.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
